## 2. Explicit Prohibitions & Restrictions

Except as expressly authorized under Section 1 or through a validated on-chain governance exemption (Section 3), **YOU MAY NOT**:

1. **Production & Mainnet Deployment:** Deploy, initialize, run, or operate the smart contracts (or substantial portions thereof) on any public or private Mainnet, layer 1, layer 2, sidechain, app-chain, roll-up, or any production environment of any blockchain (including, without limitation, Supra, Aptos, Sui, EVM-compatible chains, Solana, or Cosmos).
2. **Commercial Exploitation:** Use the Software for any commercial purpose, monetary gain, fee generation, capital formation, staking pool operation, or financial service provision.
3. **Competing Projects & Forks:** Copy, duplicate, clone, fork, modify, or adapt the codebase to launch, support, or distribute a competing protocol, decentralized exchange (DEX), token launcher, bonding curve platform, or ve(3,3) governance framework.
4. **Redistribution & Sublicensing:** Sublicense, lease, rent, sell, assign, transfer, host, or distribute copies or derivative works of the Software to third parties without prior authorization.
5. **Notice Removal:** Alter, obscure, or remove any copyright notices, license texts, or attribution tags present in the source files, package manifests (`Move.toml`), or repository roots.

